 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not trapped, you're just misplaced.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite spaces? Yes. Dangers lurking in the dark? Unfortunately. A toilet built for two? Definitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Failrooms</strong>, a first-person exploration game that takes you behind the scenes of liminal spaces. Get ready to immerse yourself in a photorealistic environment where the tension of the unknown collides head-on with the worst architectural design choices imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the side the creepypastas don't want you to see:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrifyingly absurd</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality graphics completely wasted on nonsensical hallways, ceiling stairs, and waterless pools. The atmosphere screams &quot;danger,&quot; but reality screams &quot;incompetence.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Liminal parody</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ridiculous versions and direct references to the most iconic elements of the Backrooms, giving a comedic twist to your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4179d82d3582173dbbe89eaf78b3d803.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't let your guard down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you start laughing at the terrible interior design, the place will make sure to wipe that smile right off your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/4daaff81df4da5251f7247054c180cf6.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never trust an empty hallway, or fake doors, and <strong>especially</strong> not that rubber duck. This dimension loves to play with your mind... and your nerves. Do you have what it takes to survive this architectural prank?</p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not trapped, you're just misplaced.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite spaces? Yes. Dangers lurking in the dark? Unfortunately. A toilet built for two? Definitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Failrooms</strong>, a first-person exploration game that takes you behind the scenes of liminal spaces. Get ready to immerse yourself in a photorealistic environment where the tension of the unknown collides head-on with the worst architectural design choices imaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the side the creepypastas don't want you to see:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrifyingly absurd</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality graphics completely wasted on nonsensical hallways, ceiling stairs, and waterless pools. The atmosphere screams &quot;danger,&quot; but reality screams &quot;incompetence.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.poster.avif?t=1789868673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.webm?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5217440/extras/5d244ac10a45cd65db24ce38fd00984c.mp4?t=1789868673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Liminal parody</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ridiculous versions and direct references to the most iconic elements of the Backrooms, giving a comedic twist to your worst nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >